he-top (OTT) platforms to support their club, and clubs would increasingly rely on streamed matches as a revenue source. By moving AWS, the company delivered 2.9 million streams, watched by hundreds of thousands of fans, and an overall data uplift of 500 percent – all without a hitch and with no updates to the architecture needed.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/streamamg-logo%401x.e6fd697e61e9ae6b7f10148e0d608b914ab084d3.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","customerNameLower":"streamamg ltd","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2022-12-02","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/StreamAMG-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"StreamAMG Ltd","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"StreamAMG Scores Record Viewership and Uninterrupted Delivery","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Kingdom","description":"United Kingdom","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:52+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverles