 Elemental MediaTailor","description":"AWS Elemental MediaTailor","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#resilience-hub","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Resilience Hub","description":"AWS Resilience Hub","dateCreated":"2021-11-17T07:15:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:57+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloud9","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Cloud9","description":"AWS Cloud9","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:21+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudtrail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudTrail","description":"AWS CloudTrail","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache-redis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache for Redis","description":"Amazon ElastiCache for Redis","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:16:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#fresenius05042022oikjsegflkin","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"fresenius05042022oikjsegflkin","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:16:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:30+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Fresenius Medical Care innovates with breakthrough technology using clinic medical information system data from a dialysis machine at the clinic site. The  point of care device embeds the models into the edge with Kafka feeds so that the clinic can react to patients dialysis treatment. The Kafka events feed into Kinesis Data Streams, AWS Lambda, Kinesis Data Analytics, and SageMaker visualized with Elasticsearch Service in Kibana for the near real-time feed of the patient treatment. The machine data set is used to detect the patient\u0027s blood pressure to predicting their dialysis and provide proactive measures of treatment. The data is also streamed into Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose and aggregated with the data warehouse ingested by Glue and into S3 Data Lake for further data analysis and modeling by the data scientist to discover additional predictive models for patient care.","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"fresenius medical care holdings, inc.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2022-05-04","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/wtl7CrSQnHA?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"Fresenius Medical Care Holdings, Inc.","headline":"Fresenius Medical Care: Enabling Patient Care Solutions with Near Real-Time Data-Driven Insights","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-firehose","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis Firehose","description":"Amazon Kinesis Firehose","dateCreated":"2020-05-08T03:42:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-streams","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis Data Streams","description":"Amazon Kinesis Data Streams","dateCreated":"2020-05-08T03:45:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#glue","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Glue","description":"AWS Glue","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"AI \u0026 ML","description":"AI \u0026 ML","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:30:52+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-07T13:55:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#